7
00:01:58.999 --> 00:02:02.833
Underway at this hour is the greatest
naval search in human history.

8
00:02:02.903 --> 00:02:05.133
What do you think, Sunday?
It should be you out there, ha?

9
00:02:05.205 --> 00:02:08.936
Why not? I'm the best goddamn diver in the whole U.S. Navy.

10
00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:11.020
ahahaha.. Well, you ain't in the Navy. 

11
00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.612
You! are a damn deserter.

12
00:02:12.688 --> 00:02:13.987
AWOL, AWOL.

13
00:02:14.058 --> 00:02:17.253
Twenty years ago, a man'd go
on a bender like that,

14
00:02:17.327 --> 00:02:20.091
they'd pin a medal on his chest
and take him down town for a blow job.

15
00:02:22.165 --> 00:02:25.794
Instead, you got your ass
kicked by a couple of Marines.

16
00:02:25.869 --> 00:02:30.135
- On little sleep and in freezing water.
- Ornery son of a bitch.

17
00:02:30.207 --> 00:02:34.440
-These unsung heroes of the deep
don unwieldy 250-pound suits.
-Friend of yours?

18
00:02:34.512 --> 00:02:37.913
Well, it looks like Chief here
is a goddamn nigger lover.

19
00:02:40.351 --> 00:02:43.582
All right, asshole. Now you're gonna
start addressing me as Master Chief...

20
00:02:43.654 --> 00:02:46.316
or I'm gonna snap your goddamn
wrist, do you read me?

21
00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.255
You ain't a Master Chief
no more.

22
00:02:48.326 --> 00:02:51.091
You triflin' me, motherfucker?
You triflin' me, motherfucker?

23
00:02:51.163 --> 00:02:53.495
- Sorry, Master Chief!
- Thank you!

24
00:02:53.565 --> 00:02:57.626
- Plumbing the most hostile,
unforgiving environment...

25
00:02:57.703 --> 00:02:59.637
- Carl.
- is all in a day's work.

26
00:02:59.705 --> 00:03:02.071
And yet, even as Navy ships--

27
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:53.427
Come on, Carl.

28
00:03:53.495 --> 00:03:56.726
Turn off Daddy's radio
and get ready for school.

29
00:04:12.915 --> 00:04:15.406
Whoa,John.

30
00:04:15.484 --> 00:04:20.282
Come on there.
Get a hold,John.

31
00:04:20.415 --> 00:04:23.441
Get a hold,John.

32
00:04:23.518 --> 00:04:26.146
Come on. Come on.
Get up there,Jane.

33
00:04:26.221 --> 00:04:28.815
Come on. Come on.
Good girl.

34
00:04:37.065 --> 00:04:39.000
Whoa,John.

35
00:04:39.068 --> 00:04:41.002
Come here,Jane.

36
00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.005
Come here.

37
00:04:44.073 --> 00:04:46.598
Best come in now.

38
00:04:46.676 --> 00:04:50.237
I told Doc Maddox I'd be done
by Friday, and I will.

39
00:04:51.514 --> 00:04:55.109
- Daddy, you actin' like--
- This was my farm?

40
00:04:55.184 --> 00:05:00.521
No, son. No matter how hard I work,
I ain't ever gonna own this land.

41
00:05:00.591 --> 00:05:03.685
I heard you and Mama talkin'.

42
00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.218
You gonna lose the farm
if this wheat ain't in on time.

43
00:05:07.297 --> 00:05:10.960
Doc Maddox is gonna bring in another
family, where the kids work too.

44
00:05:11.034 --> 00:05:14.299
Ho!

45
00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:20.242
My kids go to school.

46
00:05:20.311 --> 00:05:22.677
Now, go on 'fore you're late.

47
00:05:32.725 --> 00:05:37.059
I'm not going to school, Daddy.
Not today.

48
00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:39.597
Not till this field is done.

49
00:05:39.665 --> 00:05:42.395
This field ain't ever
gonna be done.

50
00:05:46.071 --> 00:05:49.063
Daddy.

51
00:05:49.141 --> 00:05:52.634
Today is Friday.

52
00:05:52.712 --> 00:05:55.146
Come on, Tye.
Come on,Jill. There you go.

53
00:05:55.215 --> 00:05:57.911
Come on.
Good boy, good girl.

54
00:05:57.984 --> 00:06:01.476
There you go.
There you go.

55
00:06:01.555 --> 00:06:04.922
- Make me a promise.
- Sir?

56
00:06:07.661 --> 00:06:10.324
Don't end up like me.

57
00:06:20.308 --> 00:06:23.471
All right.

58
00:06:23.544 --> 00:06:25.478
We best get movin'.

59
00:06:25.546 --> 00:06:28.675
Rain comin' in.

60
00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:31.150
We best get movin'.
Ready Jane,John.

61
00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.121
Get up there! Come on!

62
00:06:34.189 --> 00:06:37.181
Stay low,John.
Get the hoe,John.

63
00:06:37.259 --> 00:06:41.195
- Get the hoe! Come on. Get up there!
- Get that hoe.

64
00:06:41.263 --> 00:06:43.925
- Get the hoe,John.
- Yeah, get that hoe,Jane.

65
00:06:48.972 --> 00:06:50.906
Get that hoe,Jane.

66
00:06:50.974 --> 00:06:54.034
Ha! Get that hoe,Jane!

67
00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:57.204
Gee,Jane!
Rah! Get up there!

68
00:06:58.548 --> 00:07:00.914
Rah! Getup there!
Come on!

69
00:07:00.984 --> 00:07:04.386
Get up there! Ha!
Get up there! Ha!

70
00:07:04.455 --> 00:07:06.514
Ha! Getup there!

71
00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.751
Come on, Carl.
You'll miss the bus.

72
00:07:08.826 --> 00:07:11.021
Ho! Ho!

73
00:07:22.474 --> 00:07:25.932
Let's go, son.
Your father's waitin'on us.

74
00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:30.482
U.S. Navy's
a big opportunity for a young man.

75
00:07:30.482 --> 00:07:31.005
U.S. Navy's
a big opportunity for a young man.

76
00:07:31.082 --> 00:07:34.483
You got the hot showers.
You got the three squares a day.

77
00:07:34.552 --> 00:07:36.884
- And unlike the Army--
- All about the Navy.
It's right here in this book.

78
00:07:36.955 --> 00:07:40.050
And this is mine. I can keep this.
They're just giving it to me.

79
00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:42.890
- No fox holes in the Navy.
I wish I knew what I was gonna be.

80
00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:46.557
Knowing you,
it's gonna be something big.

81
00:07:46.632 --> 00:07:48.862
It don't stop there.

82
00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.459
He ain't said one word
since we met the recruiter.

83
00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:53.596
He's just real scared
for you.

84
00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:57.439
Coloreds now.
First uniform is paid for by Uncle Sam.

85
00:07:57.511 --> 00:08:00.173
- I love you, Mama.
- I love you.

86
00:08:00.247 --> 00:08:03.808
You'll be all right, son.

87
00:08:03.884 --> 00:08:06.978
You got a $75 pay check
just waiting for you.

88
00:08:07.054 --> 00:08:09.420
Recruiter say first leave
come in September.

89
00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:12.981
I wouldn't believe everything
that recruiter says.

90
00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:17.088
Put it away for a rainy day
or send it home to Mom and Pop.

91
00:08:17.165 --> 00:08:19.497
I'll come back,
help mow the hay.

92
00:08:19.567 --> 00:08:22.764
Don't.
Don't ever come back here.

93
00:08:24.672 --> 00:08:26.640
You get in there
and fight, Carl.

94
00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:29.677
Don't take promises.

95
00:08:29.744 --> 00:08:32.440
Bust their old rules
if you have to.

96
00:08:33.648 --> 00:08:35.947
And when it gets hard--

97
00:08:37.419 --> 00:08:39.353
and it will--

98
00:08:40.422 --> 00:08:42.356
don't quit on me.

99
00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.419
Ever.

100
00:08:47.896 --> 00:08:50.262
Now, go on.

101
00:08:50.332 --> 00:08:52.824
Don't come back here.

102
00:08:52.902 --> 00:08:55.097
Not for a long time.

103
00:09:17.128 --> 00:09:20.393
Charge it when you get
where you're going.

104
00:09:30.308 --> 00:09:32.902
"A.S.N.F."

105
00:09:32.978 --> 00:09:34.912
What's that supposed to mean?

106
00:09:36.281 --> 00:09:39.011
Mm, mm, mm.

107
00:09:40.485 --> 00:09:43.181
Come on, boy.

108
00:09:43.255 --> 00:09:45.655
You got a big future...

109
00:09:45.724 --> 00:09:48.558
