crystal ball he's lookin' through...

113
00:10:00.006 --> 00:10:02.065
and shove it
directly up his ass.

114
00:10:02.141 --> 00:10:04.337
I just got back from fightin'a war,

115
00:10:04.411 --> 00:10:07.346
makin' the whole world
free for democracy.

116
00:10:07.414 --> 00:10:10.941
They still got me standin' here,
slavin' over a hot grill next to you.

117
