132
00:11:20.491 --> 00:11:22.425
Well, I'm hot on Friday.

133
00:11:22.493 --> 00:11:24.927
Carl, crackers see that nappy
they--

134
00:11:24.996 --> 00:11:28.329
What are they gonna do,
make me wash more dishes?

135
00:11:31.035 --> 00:11:33.265
Wait a minute now.
Someone's all confused.

136
00:11:33.337 --> 00:11:35.272
Better get your ass
off this deck!

137
00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.865
It is not Tuesday, son.

138
00:11:37.943 --> 00:11:39.877
What the hell
are you doing, boy?

139
00:11:39.945 --> 00:11:43.472
- You can't do that, boy!
- You're in some deep shit!

140
00:11:45.918 --> 00:11:48.819
Wrong day, asshole!

141
00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.982
All right. Make way!

142
