144
00:12:19.987 --> 00:12:23.184
Keep goin'! Go, Carl!

145
00:12:31.733 --> 00:12:34.395
Let's go, Carl!

146
00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.477
Beat him by a mile!

147
00:12:50.319 --> 00:12:53.049
- Whoo!
- Oh!

148
00:12:59.929 --> 00:13:03.092
Okay.

149
00:13:14.711 --> 00:13:16.975
You got anything
to say for yourself?

150
00:13:25.156 --> 00:13:27.090
